# The panel on a MIPI DSI panel with touch (planning/karaoke-p4x-panel.md): the 7-inch 1024 by 600
# EK79007 panel and GT911 of Espressif's ESP32-P4X-Function-EV-Board. After sdkconfig.panel. The pins
# are that board's, from its BSP header (the Kconfig defaults of ICLFORGE_EXAMPLE_PANEL_*): check
# them against the schematic of the board the image is for.
#
# RUN 2026-10-20 on the kit (planning/karaoke-p4x-panel.md, "First run on the kit"): the bus, the
# EK79007 and the GT911 start, the screen is as designed and a tap reaches every button of the
# controls sheet. The touch layer's orientation is Kconfig (CONFIG_ICLFORGE_EXAMPLE_PANEL_TOUCH_*,
# the defaults being this board's). The read-back and touch server (an HTTP server with no
# authentication) is off: this is the release image's fragment. An image that is run on a bench turns
# it on with the panel-capture overlay (sdkconfig.panel-capture).
CONFIG_ICLFORGE_EXAMPLE_PANEL_DSI=y
CONFIG_ICLFORGE_EXAMPLE_PANEL_CAPTURE_PORT=0
